@baseUrl = http://localhost:5183/api

### Import sample data once (Development only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/seed

### Browse products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Search products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=laptop

### Filter products by category ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?categoryId=1

### Product details
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Create a guest cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts

### Replace this ID with the cart ID returned above
@cartId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Add a cart item
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Place an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "{{cartId}}",
  "couponCode": "SAVE10"
}
